/* Pure-CSS avatar swap via :has() — no helper, no template
   conditional, no dev-server restart needed. The Apple-style
   silhouette is embedded as a background-image data URI on the
   .user_holder; the <img> covers it for users with a real uploaded
   photo, and is hidden when its src matches the legacy default
   placeholder so the background SVG shows through. */
