    /* __boards-header intentionally stays in its default row layout
       on 768px (no flex-direction:column override). The previous
       column-stack collapsed the "+ New Board" button onto a second
       row below the heading, which made the header look broken on
       tablet widths. Keep the title + button on the same row; the
       title text wraps within its own flex column when there isn't
